WEBVTT

00:00:03.053 --> 00:00:03.800
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:11.064
<v><b>A:</b></v> An adjective you can use to describe food. It means that it's good for you.

00:00:14.105 --> 00:00:14.774
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:15.743 --> 00:00:20.795
<v><b>B:</b></v> For example, sun, rain, wind, and fog.

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:24.918
This is very important for farmers when they are growing food.

00:00:27.923 --> 00:00:28.597
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:33.115
<v><b>A:</b></v> For example, breakfast, lunch, or dinner.

00:00:36.117 --> 00:00:36.936
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:37.853 --> 00:00:39.649
<v><b>B:</b></v> Some food from the ocean.

00:00:42.664 --> 00:00:43.683
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:44.463 --> 00:00:46.769
<v><b>A:</b></v> The opposite of <i>difficult</i>.

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:50.539
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:51.437 --> 00:00:53.640
<v><b>B:</b></v> The opposite of <i>expensive</i>.

00:00:56.557 --> 00:00:57.564
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:58.468 --> 00:01:04.753
<v><b>A:</b></v> A short pause when you stop and rest, and maybe have a coffee or something to eat.

00:01:07.683 --> 00:01:08.416
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:01:09.326 --> 00:01:11.646
<v><b>B:</b></v> Another word for <i>very good</i>.